# Bot1's Phyrexian Metamorph entered as an artifact copy of Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla. Mirrorweave, targeting Bot1's Llanowar
# Elves, applies a later copy effect to it in layer 1 (CR 613.2a, 613.7): it is a Llanowar Elves and nothing else, not an
# artifact - the Metamorph's exception was part of the copy effect overwritten. As the turn ends Mirrorweave's effect ends and
# the Metamorph's own copy is what is left (CR 514.2, 707.2): on turn 4 it is an artifact Guerrilla Gorilla again. Bot2's
# Gorilla, a Llanowar Elves for the turn as well, is a Gorilla again.

